# --- repo ---
.DS_Store

# --- .claude: ignore runtime data, keep config + skill catalog + memories ---
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/CLAUDE.example.md
!.claude/CLAUDE.template.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/settings/
!.claude/settings/**
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/hooks/**
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/README.md
!.claude/skills/*/
!.claude/skills/*/**
!.claude/projects/
.claude/projects/*
!.claude/projects/*/
!.claude/projects/README.md
.claude/projects/*/*
!.claude/projects/*/memory/
!.claude/projects/*/memory/**
.claude/projects/*/memory/**/*.jsonl   # never track session transcripts, even inside memory/

# Runtime data from the symlinked ~/.claude/projects tree (session transcripts, caches) may
# land under .claude/projects/*/ on disk — the rules above keep only memory/ tracked.
